Job Title: Machine Learning Engineer

About the Role:
We are looking for a Machine Learning Engineer to join our AI team. You will
be responsible for building, training, and deploying machine learning models
that power our core products.

Responsibilities:
- Design and implement NLP pipelines for text classification and analysis
- Train and evaluate machine learning models using Python and Scikit-learn
- Build and maintain REST APIs to serve model predictions using Flask
- Preprocess and clean large datasets using Pandas and NumPy
- Work with TensorFlow for deep learning model development
- Deploy models to production using Docker
- Collaborate with data engineers and product teams on model integration
- Monitor model performance and retrain models as needed

Requirements:
- 2+ years of experience in Python development
- Strong understanding of machine learning and NLP concepts
- Experience with Scikit-learn, TensorFlow, Pandas, and NumPy
- Familiarity with REST API development using Flask
- Experience with SQL databases
- Knowledge of Docker and model deployment practices
- Strong problem-solving and communication skills

Nice to Have:
- Experience with feature engineering and model evaluation
- Familiarity with Git and version control workflows
- Exposure to cloud platforms such as AWS or GCP
